{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16844","headline":"淮西席上醉歌 · 卢羣","name":"淮西席上醉歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祥瑞不在凤凰麒麟，太平须得边将忠臣。\n卫霍真诚奉主，貔虎十万一身。\n江河潜注息浪，蛮貊款塞无尘。\n但得百寮师长肝胆，不用三军罗绮金银。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢羣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}